The Go rendering: a target whose root is a module, an application calling one
function of its lib package and one of a package below node_modules, which
calls back into lib, and a function nothing calls in each of that package, a
second node_modules package at the root, a node_modules directory below lib, a
.cache directory, an _examples directory and a testdata directory.

